---
description: >-
  Wardley map exercising multiple link syntaxes on one diagram: a plain
  link, a flow link (`+>`), a constraint-annotated link, a bidirectional
  flow link (`+<>`), a reverse flow link (`+<`), and a custom-labeled flow
  link (`+'backup'>`).
---
wardley-beta
  title Link Features Demo
  size [1100, 800]

  component User [0.95, 0.90]
  component App [0.75, 0.75]
  component API [0.60, 0.60]
  component Cache [0.65, 0.45]
  component Database [0.15, 0.80]
  component Service [0.45, 0.50]

  User -> App
  App +> API; +>
  API -> Database; constraint
  API +<> Cache; +<>
  Cache +< Service; +<
  Service +'backup'> Database
